
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Creative Duo</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:linear-gradient(135deg,#eaf4ff,#ffffff);
color:#17365d;
}
header{
padding:25px 8%;
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
align-items:center;
background:#fff;
box-shadow:0 3px 15px #cbdcf0;
}
.logo{font-size:23px;font-weight:bold;color:#1765b1}
nav a{
margin-left:20px;
text-decoration:none;
color:#24527d;
font-weight:bold;
}
.hero{
text-align:center;
padding:100px 20px 75px;
}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,65px);color:#145da0}
.hero p{font-size:18px;margin:20px 0;color:#527494}
.btn{
display:inline-block;
background:#176bc1;
color:white;
padding:14px 28px;
border-radius:30px;
text-decoration:none;
font-weight:bold;
}
section{padding:55px 8%;text-align:center}
section h2{font-size:32px;margin-bottom:30px}
.profiles{
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
flex-wrap:wrap;
gap:25px;
}
.card{
background:white;
width:280px;
padding:30px 20px;
border-radius:20px;
box-shadow:0 8px 25px #c9dced;
transition:.3s;
}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px)}
.avatar{
width:110px;height:110px;
border-radius:50%;
margin:0 auto 20px;
background:#e3f0ff;
display:grid;
place-items:center;
font-size:45px;
}
.card h3{font-size:24px;margin-bottom:10px}
.card p{color:#64809c;margin-bottom:20px}
.card a{color:#176bc1;text-decoration:none;font-weight:bold}
.about{
background:#fff;
border-radius:20px;
padding:35px;
max-width:750px;
margin:auto;
line-height:1.8;
}
footer{
background:#145da0;
color:white;
text-align:center;
padding:25px;
margin-top:40px;
}
@media(max-width:600px){
header{flex-direction:column;gap:15px}
nav a{margin:0 7px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<div class="logo">THE CREATIVE DUO ✨</div>
<nav>
<a href="#home">Home</a>
<a href="#profiles">Profiles</a>
<a href="#about">About</a>
</nav>
</header>

<div class="hero" id="home">
<h1>THE CREATIVE DUO</h1>
<p>Two Personalities. Two Journeys. One Digital Space.</p>
<a href="#profiles" class="btn">MEET THE DUO</a>
</div>

<section id="profiles">
<h2>MEET THE DUO 💙</h2>
<div class="profiles">

<div class="card">
<div class="avatar">👑</div>
<h3>AARYA</h3>
<p>Welcome to my digital space!</p>
<a href="https://www.instagram.com/kingaarya11/" target="_blank">Instagram ↗</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<div class="avatar">✨</div>
<h3>MITHRA</h3>
<p>Welcome to my digital space!</p>
<a href="https://www.instagram.com/geesamithra/" target="_blank">Instagram ↗</a>
</div>

</div>
</section>

<section id="about">
<h2>ABOUT US</h2>
<div class="about">
Welcome to The Creative Duo! 💙<br>
A space celebrating creativity, individuality and connection.
Two profiles, two unique personalities, one shared digital space.
</div>
</section>

<footer>
THE CREATIVE DUO © 2026
<br><br>
Made with 💙 by Aarya & Mithra
</footer>

</body>
</html>
